      "html": "<aside class=\"blog-related bg-charcoal pointer-events-auto\" aria-labelledby=\"blog-related-heading\"><section class=\"blog-index-shell\" data-v-1c6297c3><p class=\"blog-eyebrow\">Keep reading</p><h2 id=\"blog-related-heading\" class=\"blog-section-heading\">More useful growth ideas.</h2><div class=\"blog-index-grid\"><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/ai-is-a-forcing-function-not-a-feature\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--ads\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">Google Ads</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"160\" r=\"120\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"160\" r=\"75\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"160\" r=\"27\"/><path d=\"M50 160H120M480 160H550\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Reach intent.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">Make your offer the starting point for paid campaigns</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Clarify the customer, the promise and the next step before choosing campaign settings or commissioning advertisements.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 2 min read</p></div></a><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/best-ai-automation-agencies-uk-2026\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--ads\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">Google Ads</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"160\" r=\"120\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"160\" r=\"75\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"160\" r=\"27\"/><path d=\"M50 160H120M480 160H550\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Reach intent.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">What a paid media agency should report every month</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">A monthly paid media report should explain spending, meaningful responses, lead quality and the decisions that follow.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 2 min read</p></div></a><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/10-questions-to-ask-before-hiring-a-digital-product-agency\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--strategy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">Growth strategy</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M50 210H170V100H310V155H510\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"210\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"100\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"510\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Connect the dots.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">10 questions to ask a growth agency</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Ten questions that reveal how an agency connects search, paid media and content with the customers your business needs.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 3 min read</p></div></a></div></section></aside>"
